    "name": "Neon Grid Defenders",
    "steam_appid": 2890810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/bfb3886bda577bb174110d519736338a.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a0a98bdde89f466d2f426f9333d292b2.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a0a98bdde89f466d2f426f9333d292b2.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Have you ever thought, &quot;I wish I could give this tower a double shot upgrade. It would be OP!&quot; If the answer is yes, then Neon Grid Defenders will give you that freedom. You can give any upgrade to any tower! Throughout your run, you will accumulate a lot of upgrades from different rarities. The higher the rarity, the more powerful the upgrade! Create satisfying combos with your towers that destroy your enemies in seconds! A time-based difficulty curve will keep you on your toes and test your strategy. After each run, you will be able to unlock different progressions to make you stronger for the next one, along with the freedom to expand the path however you want with as many splits as you want!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/5ed8d5a1bdd71718bd5439d13bcc7c58.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tA large variety of towers each with distinct stats and effects that rewards careful planning and skill<br></li><li>\tA lot of upgrades! Give any upgrade to any tower. Thats right, you can give double shot to your sprayers if that\u2019s what you want<br></li><li>\tUnique and interesting enemies with passive abilities<br></li><li>\tChallenging boss waves that will test your build<br></li><li>\tVariety of game modes to spice up your gameplay<br></li><li>\tPath generation that allows you to choose your own difficulty by not forcing you to create additional spawn points<br></li><li>\tScalling difficulty with time</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/67815bd39dc44654c0940a081f484fe1.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After surviving a wave you will select, from a choice of 3, a road tile and a game modification that will allow you to specialize your build.<br></li><li>Between every wave you will need to place that road tile and create a new spawn point or extend an existing one further away.<br></li><li>Spend your earned power from destroying enemies to build more towers or upgrade them. Adding upgrade to them is free as long as you have any left. You can replace upgrades for free but the one being replaced is destroyed. Likewise, when you sell a tower you lose all upgrades you've given to it.<br></li><li>The game difficulty progresses with time. Splitting the road makes the enemies spawn faster and allows you to go further in the game with lower difficulty. The higher the difficulty the more enemies come and more health they have.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Road</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a7d2b9966f775488c3c24c32febb794d.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a7d2b9966f775488c3c24c32febb794d.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add upgrades to towers</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/433a4ef7064ffd46fa47d54ea4b65561.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/433a4ef7064ffd46fa47d54ea4b65561.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/291278371bfc9914dd631eaa9e51212a.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tDifficult to start but easier as you unlock progression<br></li><li>\tDiversity of towers and upgrades and the freedom to mix and match them however you want<br></li><li>\tA lot of roguelite elements designed to spice up your runs but not make you lose them if you change your strategy<br></li><li>\tMinimalistic sci-fi theme with satisfying combos<br></li><li>\tAs an optimization enthusiast expect the game to perform well!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/bfb3886bda577bb174110d519736338a.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a0a98bdde89f466d2f426f9333d292b2.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a0a98bdde89f466d2f426f9333d292b2.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Have you ever thought, &quot;I wish I could give this tower a double shot upgrade. It would be OP!&quot; If the answer is yes, then Neon Grid Defenders will give you that freedom. You can give any upgrade to any tower! Throughout your run, you will accumulate a lot of upgrades from different rarities. The higher the rarity, the more powerful the upgrade! Create satisfying combos with your towers that destroy your enemies in seconds! A time-based difficulty curve will keep you on your toes and test your strategy. After each run, you will be able to unlock different progressions to make you stronger for the next one, along with the freedom to expand the path however you want with as many splits as you want!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/5ed8d5a1bdd71718bd5439d13bcc7c58.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tA large variety of towers each with distinct stats and effects that rewards careful planning and skill<br></li><li>\tA lot of upgrades! Give any upgrade to any tower. Thats right, you can give double shot to your sprayers if that\u2019s what you want<br></li><li>\tUnique and interesting enemies with passive abilities<br></li><li>\tChallenging boss waves that will test your build<br></li><li>\tVariety of game modes to spice up your gameplay<br></li><li>\tPath generation that allows you to choose your own difficulty by not forcing you to create additional spawn points<br></li><li>\tScalling difficulty with time</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/67815bd39dc44654c0940a081f484fe1.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After surviving a wave you will select, from a choice of 3, a road tile and a game modification that will allow you to specialize your build.<br></li><li>Between every wave you will need to place that road tile and create a new spawn point or extend an existing one further away.<br></li><li>Spend your earned power from destroying enemies to build more towers or upgrade them. Adding upgrade to them is free as long as you have any left. You can replace upgrades for free but the one being replaced is destroyed. Likewise, when you sell a tower you lose all upgrades you've given to it.<br></li><li>The game difficulty progresses with time. Splitting the road makes the enemies spawn faster and allows you to go further in the game with lower difficulty. The higher the difficulty the more enemies come and more health they have.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Road</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a7d2b9966f775488c3c24c32febb794d.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/a7d2b9966f775488c3c24c32febb794d.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add upgrades to towers</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/433a4ef7064ffd46fa47d54ea4b65561.poster.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/433a4ef7064ffd46fa47d54ea4b65561.webm?t=1752351381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890810/extras/291278371bfc9914dd631eaa9e51212a.avif?t=1752351381\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tDifficult to start but easier as you unlock progression<br></li><li>\tDiversity of towers and upgrades and the freedom to mix and match them however you want<br></li><li>\tA lot of roguelite elements designed to spice up your runs but not make you lose them if you change your strategy<br></li><li>\tMinimalistic sci-fi theme with satisfying combos<br></li><li>\tAs an optimization enthusiast expect the game to perform well!</li></ul>",
